SUMMARY:DJ Quik
LOCATION:Garden Amphitheatre\, Garden Grove
DESCRIPTION:DJ QUIK is a legendary rapper\, producer\, and DJ from Compton\
 
, California\, known for pioneering G-funk with his self-titled debut album
 
 Quik is the Name (1991) featuring hits like "Tonite" and "Born and Raised 
 
In Compton\," blending funk with West Coast hip-hop\, and establishing hims
 
elf as a versatile artist who's collaborated with legends like Snoop Dogg\,
 
 2Pac\, and Jay-Z\, while also overcoming early homelessness and gang invol
 
vement to become a multi-platinum selling\, influential figure in music and
 
 film soundtracks. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/dj-quik-
 
garden-amphitheatre-tickets/14033294
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/dj-quik-garden-amphitheatre-tickets/140
 
33294
